[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Mismatches found and fixed
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### 1. `SIGPIPE` was ignored, so the Rust program survived a closed stdout
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
