[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `sigpipe_terminates_both_programs_the_same_way`, which asserts the C program is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     46[0m:[38;5;10m[49m killed by signal 13 and that the Rust program matches.
